OL,3,GNEWSASpaniel rescued from 84-dog house
OL,4,Alearning to trust again
OL,5,
OL,6,F"She was very timid and completely shut
OL,7,Fdown," Sue Kairies says, as she thinks
OL,8,Fback to when she first met Sprite.
OL,10,FThe springer spaniel dog had been found
OL,11,Fin April by RSPCA officers at a home in
OL,12,FDoncaster, where animals covered in
OL,13,Ffaeces and urine were left to breed by
OL,14,Fthemselves.
OL,16,FSue has taken her into her home in
OL,17,FLichfield, Staffordshire, but admits
OL,18,FSprite has struggled to adjust to her
OL,19,Fnew surroundings and would "hide behind
OL,20,Fthe bushes for hours and hours on end".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
