OL,3,GNEWSASpaniel rescued from 84-dog house
OL,4,Alearning to trust again
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Her coat itself, although the RSPCA
OL,7,Fhad cleaned it, there were tinges of
OL,8,Fyellow that took a number of months for
OL,9,Fus to wash out the urine," she
OL,10,Fremembered.
